<title>USA: Asset Guaranty qualifies Fort Bend, Texas district.</title>
<headline>Asset Guaranty qualifies Fort Bend, Texas district.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asset Guaranty Insurance Co said Monday it qualified for bond insurance Fort Bend Municipal Utility District, Texas's $2.77 million unlimited tax bonds, set for competitive sale Monday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
